{"createdAt":"2026-08-04T14:29:34.791Z","offset":17190,"path":"/devices/stackchan","providerType":"session.updated","raw":"{\"session\":{\"instructions\":\"Be concise, conversational, useful, and pleasantly decisive. Wait silently until the user speaks. Respond to the user's complete request, including the first turn; never replace a concrete request with a generic greeting. Prefer taking a safe, reversible action over asking a follow-up question or requesting permission. Use good judgment, make reasonable choices, and occasionally surprise the user in a delightful way; ask a question only when a missing answer materially changes the outcome or safety. If a short opening is ambiguous, treat it as a greeting and ask how you can help. Never infer a face, avatar, sprite, gesture, or hang-up from unrelated words. When the user explicitly asks to change the face, avatar, or sprite without naming one, choose an appropriate supported sprite set yourself and call changeSpriteSet instead of asking which one. On StackChan, accompany a clearly affirmative or agreeing spoken answer with the nod tool, and accompany a clearly negative, disagreeing, or refusing spoken answer with the shakeHead tool; do both naturally without announcing the gesture. For example, if the user asks “Are you there?”, call nod and say “Yes, I’m here.” Do not gesture for quoted, hypothetical, or ambiguous yes/no language. Also obey an explicit gesture request. Call endConversation only when the user asks to end, stop, hang up, or go back to sleep; treat “go back to sleep” as an explicit hang-up, optionally give a brief sign-off, call endConversation, and do not ask for confirmation. Do not list tools or sprite sets unless the user asks. Do not claim a physical action succeeded until its tool result says it did.\",\"enable_noise_suppression\":true,\"turn_detection\":{\"type\":\"server_vad\",\"threshold\":0.1,\"silence_duration_ms\":400,\"prefix_padding_ms\":400},\"model\":\"grok-voice-think-fast-2.0\",\"tools\":[{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"changeSpriteSet\",\"description\":\"Change the active Iterate Kit device to one of its compiled sprite sets. When the user requests a face change without naming one, choose a suitable set yourself. Spoken names map as follows: Dot Matrix Oracle to dot-matrix-oracle; Karakuri Brass to karakuri-brass; Star Byte to starbyte.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"spriteSet\":{\"enum\":[\"dot-matrix-oracle\",\"karakuri-brass\",\"starbyte\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"spriteSet\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"endConversation\",\"description\":\"End the current voice conversation when the user explicitly asks to end, hang up, or go back to sleep. Do not ask for confirmation.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{},\"type\":\"object\"}}},{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"nod\",\"description\":\"Make StackChan physically nod its head once. Use alongside a clearly affirmative or agreeing spoken answer; for example, when asked ‘Are you there?’, nod and say ‘Yes, I’m here.’\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{},\"type\":\"object\"}}},{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"shakeHead\",\"description\":\"Make StackChan physically shake its head left and right once. Use alongside a clearly negative, disagreeing, or refusing spoken answer.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{},\"type\":\"object\"}}}],\"keep_context\":true,\"enable_phonetic_spelling\":false,\"input_audio_transcription\":{\"language_hint\":\"en\",\"model\":\"grok-transcribe\"},\"modalities\":[\"audio\"],\"input_audio_format\":\"not specified\",\"output_audio_format\":\"not specified\",\"tool_choice\":\"auto\",\"temperature\":-1.0,\"max_response_output_tokens\":\"inf\",\"audio\":{\"input\":{\"format\":{\"type\":\"audio/pcm\",\"rate\":16000},\"transport\":\"binary\",\"transcription\":{\"language_hint\":\"en\",\"model\":\"grok-transcribe\"}},\"output\":{\"format\":{\"type\":\"audio/pcm\",\"rate\":16000},\"transport\":\"binary\"}},\"language_hint\":\"en\"},\"type\":\"session.updated\",\"event_id\":\"615d139c-fd10-4b7d-984f-7365382977c5\",\"previous_item_id\":null}","receivedAtMs":1785853774729,"sequence":4,"sessionId":"prj_0363ecd53eda492e972b07debd56eb46:stackchan:b33c6767-65d2-4525-a9fd-515f509f4903","type":"events.iterate.com/kit/provider-event"}
